s":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/51","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestone/51","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/milestones/51/labels","id":3850624,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMzg1MDYyNA==","number":51,"title":"1.4","description":null,"creator":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":263,"state":"closed","created_at":"2018-11-27T04:11:27Z","updated_at":"2023-03-07T15:41:37Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2021-03-18T12:29:03Z"},"comments":14,"created_at":"2020-09-27T20:53:37Z","updated_at":"2020-11-19T21:07:12Z","closed_at":"2020-11-19T21:07:12Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the bug**\r\n\r\nAfter greenlet 0.4.17 supports PEP-567 in python-greenlet/greenlet#172, SQLAlchemy async engine is not setting the context correctly in `greenlet_spawn()`, causing bugs in retrieving context variables in sync methods like event handlers.\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n\r\nThe context is passed down and context variables are working properly, please see example below.\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\n\r\n```py\r\nimport asyncio\r\nfrom contextvars import ContextVar\r\n\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import event\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.asyncio import create_async_engine\r\n\r\nvar = ContextVar(\"var\", default=\"default\")\r\n\r\n\r\ndef on_connect(dbapi_connection, connection_record):\r\n    print(var.get())\r\n\r\n\r\nasync def main():\r\n    e = create_async_engine(\"postgresql+asyncpg:///\")\r\n    event.listen(e.sync_engine, \"connect\", on_connect)\r\n\r\n    var.set(\"expected\")\r\n    async with e.connect():\r\n        pass\r\n\r\n\r\nasyncio.run(main())\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Expected**: `expected`\r\n\r\n**Actual**: `default`\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n\r\n - OS: Darwin Kernel Version 19.5.0\r\n - Python: Python 3.8.2\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.4.0b1 @ ffafbd4b9657a4ee8bec57c0861414144f37bdc5\r\n - Database: PostgreSQL 12.4\r\n - DBAPI: asyncpg 0.21.0\r\n - greenlet: 0.4.17\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nAsync methods called from such sync methods by `await_only()` is not affected, because the async method is actually called within the parent greenlet, where the PEP-567 context is correct. For example, this would generate `expected`:\r\n\r\n```python\r\nasync def async_on_connect():\r\n    print(var.get())\r\n\r\ndef on_connect(dbapi_connection, connection_record):\r\n    await_only(async_on_connect())\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Have a nice day!**","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5615/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}